  "mission_id": "ai-army-monetization-and-media-20260912",
  "objective": "Preserve and improve the AI Army, long-form video production, and rights-safe monetization systems using evidence-driven, bounded, resumable orchestration. New chat tabs or agent sessions must restore project rules from repository state instead of relying on conversational memory.",
  "continuity": {
